      "writtenOn": "2019-02-26T06:16:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This needs comments ; I don\u0027t think I understand the logic. I understand you\u0027re trying to estimate how many records you need to drop to get under the threshold, but you\u0027re then multiplying the ratio by 0.5.\n\nIf your estimate is sound and all the records represent about the same size, then you\u0027ll remove about half what you need to remove. Then you\u0027ll remove half again. You start with a 12MB database, you\u0027ll remove 1MB worth of records, then 500k worth of records, then 250k worth of records, and so on.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 471,
        "startChar": 32,
        "endLine": 471,
        "endChar": 95
      },
      "revId": "ab89c6e34abe47ff14df9828cf419977bbbc6ccf",
